TITLE Albite kinetics + fixed P(H2S) gas, pe at step 100
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2 charge
    pe 0
    units mmol/kgw
    Fe(3) 4
    Fe(2) 4

GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure true
    -pressure 5
    H2S(g) 5

KINETICS 1
    Albite
        -m0 1
        -m  1
        -parms 1.0 10
        -tol 1e-12
    -steps 10 in 100

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -time true
    -step true
    -pe true
END
